SLP will increasingly involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-based speech analysis"},{"text":"Automated speech recognition"},{"text":"Digital speech biomarkers"},{"text":"Tele-SLP"},{"text":"AI-assisted language assessment"},{"text":"Personalized digital therapy"},{"text":"Advanced AAC"},{"text":"Eye-tracking communication systems"},{"text":"Voice analytics"},{"text":"VR-based rehabilitation"},{"text":"Wearable communication technologies"},{"text":"Digital therapeutics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future-facing combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clinical SLP","Neurorehabilitation","AAC","Speech Technology","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Sciences"},{"text":"├── Anatomy"},{"text":"├── Physiology"},{"text":"├── Psychology"},{"text":"├── Linguistics"},{"text":"└── Communication Sciences"},{"text":"Speech & Language"},{"text":"├── Speech Assessment"},{"text":"├── Language Assessment"},{"text":"├── Articulation"},{"text":"├── Phonology"},{"text":"├── Fluency"},{"text":"├── Voice"},{"text":"├── Motor Speech"},{"text":"└── Cognitive Communication"},{"text":"Clinical Specialization"},{"text":"├── Paediatric SLP"},{"text":"├── Neuro-SLP"},{"text":"├── AAC"},{"text":"├── Dysphagia"},{"text":"└── Rehabilitation"},{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"├── Digital Assessment"},{"text":"├── Tele-SLP"},{"text":"├── Acoustic Analysis"},{"text":"├── Speech Processing"},{"text":"├── Python"},{"text":"└── AI/NLP"},{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"├── Patient Counselling"},{"text":"├── Family Training"},{"text":"├── Clinical Documentation"},{"text":"├── Team Collaboration"},{"text":"├── Evidence-Based Practice"},{"text":"└── Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conduct structured speech and language assessments under appropriate supervision."},{"text":"Develop individualized therapy goals."},{"text":"Deliver evidence-based speech and language intervention."},{"text":"Work with paediatric and adult populations."},{"text":"Understand aphasia, dysarthria, apraxia and developmental communication disorders."},{"text":"Apply basic AAC principles."},{"text":"Understand feeding and swallowing disorders and appropriate referral pathways."},{"text":"Maintain professional clinical documentation."},{"text":"Communicate effectively with patients, families and multidisciplinary teams."},{"text":"Use digital clinical tools and telepractice appropriately."},{"text":"Understand basic speech acoustics and signal analysis."},{"text":"Use Excel and basic data-analysis tools."},{"text":"Complete supervised clinical placements across relevant settings."},{"text":"Conduct a meaningful SLP research or technology project."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["BASLP","Clinical Speech-Language Pathologist","Build paediatric/neuro/voice/AAC specialization","Advanced clinical qualification","Senior Specialist / Clinical Coordinator / Academic / Research / Digital Health pathway"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the 2026+ AI era, the strongest profile is not just a traditional speech therapist, but a clinically strong SLP who can combine evidence-based therapy with neurorehabilitation, AAC, digital assessment, telepractice and AI-assisted speech technology."}]}]}